      "content": "it's just not just \"processing\" anymore. it feels like a physical weight on my chest every single second. i look at his side of the bed and it's just... empty. a void. i'm so tired of fighting to feel okay when everything feels so meaningless without him. i just want the pain to stop. i want to be where he is.",
